      "heading": "① 放進一整族",
      "body": [
        "把次方 $2$ 換成參數 $a$：",
        "對 $a$ 偏微分：$\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial a}\\,\\dfrac{x^a-1}{\\ln x}=\\dfrac{x^a\\ln x}{\\ln x}=x^a$",
        "難纏的 $\\frac1{\\ln x}$ 被消掉了：這就是放參數的目的",
        "積回去：$I(a)=\\ln(a+1)+C$",
        "$a=0$：被積函數 $\\equiv0$，$I(0)=0$ ⇒ $C=0$",
        "數值驗算：$\\approx1.0986$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_0^1\\frac{x^2-1}{\\ln x}\\,dx",
        "I(a)=\\int_0^1\\frac{x^a-1}{\\ln x}\\,dx,\\qquad\\text{要的是 }I(2)",
        "I'(a)=\\int_0^1x^a\\,dx=\\frac1{a+1}",
        "\\int_0^1\\frac{x^2-1}{\\ln x}\\,dx=I(2)=\\ln3"
