    {
      "heading": "③ 範例 3：$\\frac1{x^2}$ 卡住",
      "body": [
        "$\\partial_a$ 拉下 $x^2$，消掉分母：",
        "$\\int_0^\\infty e^{-u^2}du=\\frac12\\Gamma(\\frac12)=\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2$（11.17）",
        "積回去：$I(a)=\\sqrt{\\pi a}+C$；$I(0)=0$",
        "右連續：$1-e^{-t}\\le\\min(t,1)$ ⇒ $0\\le I(a)\\le\\int_0^\\infty\\min\\!\\big(a,\\tfrac1{x^2}\\big)dx=2\\sqrt a$",
        "$\\min$ 的積分：$\\int_0^{1/\\sqrt a}a\\,dx+\\int_{1/\\sqrt a}^\\infty\\frac{dx}{x^2}=\\sqrt a+\\sqrt a$"
