        "I'(a)=\\int_0^\\infty e^{-ax^2}\\,dx=\\frac1{\\sqrt a}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2",
        "C=0,\\qquad\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{1-e^{-x^2}}{x^2}\\,dx=\\sqrt\\pi"
